{"id":"sh/9gza9sze","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 9","position":{"left":89.28,"top":394.56,"width":144,"height":26.88},"text":"1か月以内","style":{"fontSize":14.67,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/mdobedg3","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 10","position":{"left":89.28,"top":429.12,"width":1100.16,"height":56},"text":"机上の試作でSLAS補正の有無、送信遅延、消費電力を測る。協力者は計10人を目標。","style":{"fontSize":21,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/nehs7iho","kind":"shape","name":"Shape 11","position":{"left":72,"top":500.16,"width":1134.72,"height":92.16},"style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#F5F7FA","lineColor":"#D9DEE7","lineWidth":1.33},
{"id":"sh/0b6tc3yx","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 12","position":{"left":89.28,"top":511.68,"width":144,"height":26.88},"text":"3か月以内","style":{"fontSize":14.67,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/1cfa58zi","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 13","position":{"left":89.28,"top":546.24,"width":1100.16,"height":56},"text":"アプリで模擬捜索を実演。安全確認後に3家庭で試用し、費用・装着・購入意思を見直す。","style":{"fontSize":21,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
